### Kernel Launch FPE Root Cause
- `maxThreadsPerMultiProcessor` was 0 → FPE (division by zero in RNG config)
- Our `cudaGetDeviceProperties` wrote attr 39 at WRONG offset (460)
- PyTorch (CUDA 12.8) reads it from offset 624 (struct layout diverged)
- Empirically determined correct offsets using CHIDORI_OFFSET_DIAG pattern fill

